          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 580,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.060:block:1",
          "start": 132
        },
        "quote": "The Authority Having Jurisdiction shall be the Authority duly appointed to enforce this code. The Authority Having Jurisdiction shall have the power to render interpretations of this code and to adopt and enforce rules and regulations supplemental to this code as deemed necessary in order to clarify the application of the provisions of this code. Such interpretations, rules, and regulations shall comply with the intent and purpose of this code.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.060:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.35.060 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "1fa1112d-c949-5dde-a944-7bc41d3f1748",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1014,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.060:block:2",
          "start": 581
        },
        "quote": "In accordance with the prescribed procedures and with the approval of the appointing authority, the Authority Having Jurisdiction shall be permitted to appoint such number of technical officers, inspectors and other employees as shall be authorized from time to time. The Authority Having Jurisdiction shall be permitted to deputize such inspectors or employees as necessary to carry out the functions of the code enforcement agency.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.060:block:2#text",
